; HSMW-CNC v1
PARAM SetupName Setup1
PARAM OperationName Drill
PARAM OperationKind Drilling
PARAM StartX 105
PARAM StartY 30
PARAM StartZ 15
PARAM ToolKind drill
PARAM ToolDiameter 6
PARAM SpindleSpeed 1500
PARAM WorkOffset 2
PARAM OriginX 100
PARAM OriginY 25
PARAM OriginZ 5
PARAM ClearancePlane 15
PARAM RetractPlane 12
PARAM TopOfStock 10
PARAM StockXYLeft 80
PARAM StockXYRight 120
PARAM StockXYFront 10
PARAM StockXYBack 40
PARAM StockZTop 10
PARAM StockZBottom -3
PARAM Coolant off
TOOL 3 DRILL-6
SECTION
Rapid X 105000 Y 30000 Z 15000
Rapid X 105000 Y 30000 Z 11000
CYCLE DRILL X 105000 Y 30000 Z 0 R 11000 ENTRY 10000 Q 0 P 500 F 100000
Plunge X 105000 Y 30000 Z 0 F 100000
Rapid X 105000 Y 30000 Z 11000
Rapid X 105000 Y 30000 Z 12000
Rapid X 115000 Y 30000 Z 12000
Rapid X 115000 Y 30000 Z 11000
CYCLE DRILL X 115000 Y 30000 Z 0 R 11000 ENTRY 10000 Q 0 P 500 F 100000
Plunge X 115000 Y 30000 Z 0 F 100000
Rapid X 115000 Y 30000 Z 11000
Rapid X 115000 Y 30000 Z 12000
Rapid X 115000 Y 30000 Z 15000
ENDSECTION
